{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with an email.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a little game in the attachment. A simple spot-the-difference puzzle. You\u2019ve seen a thousand of them.<br>What\u2019s the harm in one more download?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smile Dog</strong> is a psychological horror experience inspired by the classic 2008 creepypasta - a descent into early internet dread, where the line between fiction, memory, and malware gets... blurry.<br><br>The game lasts about <strong>~45 minutes</strong> and have <strong>3\u00a0endings</strong>, perfect for a quick, &quot;relaxing&quot; experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/11331e2e85592b989170533b5afb349d.avif?t=1756335049\" width=932 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Desktop <i>is</i> the Game:</strong> Watch your own system turn against you. Wallpapers glitch. Images are unsettling. The UI breaks in ways that feel a little <i>too</i> real. Something is slipping through - and it\u2019s not part of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Inbox is Watching:\u00a0</strong>It starts with spam. Then it starts getting... personal. The story unfolds through emails that know things they shouldn\u2019t. Some of them feel like they're waiting for you to reply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Creepypasta Reimagined:\u00a0</strong>This is <i>Smile Dog</i> like you\u2019ve never seen it. We\u2019ve kept the spirit of the original, but added a new layer of unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trhee Possible Endings: </strong>Your choices - or your failures - decide how the story closes. Each ending reveals a different layer of the Smile Dog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/fc16f017ff4b60c6325491ea816b1f31.avif?t=1756335049\" width=690 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>CONTENT WARNING\u00a0</strong>\u26a0\ufe0f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains psychological horror elements including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing imagery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implied manipulation or system interference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content that may cause anxiety, paranoia, or unease</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not recommended for children or anyone sensitive to psychological horror themes.<br><strong>Smile Dog doesn\u2019t care about your boundaries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/8df663054341fd54671ade3fd88fe584.avif?t=1756335049\" width=1062 height=226 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You've Got Mail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895360/76bf20b91f0e7c99c2e968a9bf46015e51a3fe7c.jpg"},{"name":"Reality Check","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895360/845f7ee95c23319fed83d1f31bb9f000ee6974c5.jpg"},{"name":"Chain Letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895360/0b3c18fff9550b98bb71727d569877c91ddb1b13.jpg"},{"name":"Night Owl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895360/bac974facc7d9b6aeb60edce677bc18f59d8aa07.jpg"},{"name":"Inbox Zero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com